">\n  <div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n  \n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\"} -->\n<h2\n    class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\"\n  >Use With Care</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n  \n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Helpful guidance for introducing Youth Face Beauty Cream thoughtfully.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  \n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n<hr\n    class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\n    style=\"\n      margin-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);\n      margin-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);\n    \"\n  />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<div\n    class=\"wp-block-group\"\n    style=\"\n      padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n      padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n    \"\n  >\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How should I patch test?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before first use, apply a small amount to a discreet area of clean, dry skin. Follow the product label and allow time to observe how your skin responds. Stop use if irritation occurs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<div\n    class=\"wp-block-group\"\n    style=\"\n      padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n      padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n    \"\n  >\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How do I use Youth Face Beauty Cream?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use only as directed on the product label. Apply to clean, dry skin and avoid the eye area unless the label says otherwise. Start slowly when introducing any new skincare product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<div\n    class=\"wp-block-group\"\n    style=\"\n      padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n      padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n    \"\n  >\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I use several new products together?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is generally easier to understand your skin’s response when you introduce one new product at a time. Keep the rest of your routine simple while you get familiar with it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<div\n    class=\"wp-block-group\"\n    style=\"\n      padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n      padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n    \"\n  >\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When should I expect results?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Skincare results vary from person to person. Give your routine time and use products consistently as directed. Avoid expecting overnight changes or guaranteed outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<div\n    class=\"wp-block-group\"\n    style=\"\n      padding-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n      padding-bottom: var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);\n    \"\n  >\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What if my skin feels irritated?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stop using the product and simplify your routine. If discomfort continues or you have concerns about your skin, consult a qualified healthcare professional or dermatologist.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"shapeDividerBottom\":\"inherit\",\"className\":\"is-style-default is-style-shape-divider airo-section-7b452f5d-08ba-4090-aa1c-c1fc824c3046 is-style-section-1\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\"}}},\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"CTA - Centered Full Width with Headline Subheading and Button\",\"description\":\"Centered full-width section containing heading, description, and CTA button stacked vertically\",\"categories\":[\"gd-cta\"],\"sophisticationTier\":1,\"industries\":[\"saas\",\"b2b\",\"ecommerce\",\"hospitality\",\"health\",\"creative\",\"legal\",\"fitness\",\"bridal\",\"education\"],\"vibes\":[\"professional\",\"modern\"],\"background\":[\"no-background\"],\"cardStyle\":[\"no-cards\"]},\"anchor\":\"7b452f5d-08ba-4090-aa1c-c1fc824c3046\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-default is-style-shape-divider dsgo-stack--has-shape-divider airo-section-7b452f5d-08ba-4090-aa1c-c1fc824c3046 is-style-section-1\" style=\"margin-top:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" id=\"7b452f5d-08ba-4090-aa1c-c1fc824c3046\">\n  <div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n  \n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"600px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":6} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">\n      Your Routine\n    </h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">\n      Keep Skincare Consistent\n    </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Explore Youth Face Beauty Cream and follow the product directions as part of your everyday routine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n    \n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n      \n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-primary\">\n        <a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/shop/\"\n          >Shop Youth Face</a\n        >\n      </div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n    </div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->"
